{"4065900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ranger", "steam_appid": 4065900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/6611e951154c25ae5f7e484143ac7db7.poster.avif?t=1780884504\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/6611e951154c25ae5f7e484143ac7db7.webm?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/6611e951154c25ae5f7e484143ac7db7.mp4?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger is a short, permadeath adventure game. You'll collect surprising spells, forage for useful trinkets, face off against gnarly beasts and, if you're lucky, discover what lies at the end of the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/141e9a72e6f8d9a533cf4604c8eae1de.avif?t=1780884504\" width=1028 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/670a60db3810b627644882b94bc5caa5.poster.avif?t=1780884504\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/670a60db3810b627644882b94bc5caa5.webm?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/670a60db3810b627644882b94bc5caa5.mp4?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger recaptures the sense of discovery and wonder of the early 1980s ASCII adventures by being completely text-less and number-less: you'll need to discover the rules of the world using your intuition, creativity and wits in order to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/2d462cb022796a5fa4e4c96745874e66.avif?t=1780884504\" width=1028 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/2987245966a6b9498121f4222463ebbd.poster.avif?t=1780884504\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/2987245966a6b9498121f4222463ebbd.webm?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/2987245966a6b9498121f4222463ebbd.mp4?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like all good games, in Ranger you'll begin at the base of a waterfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes: get lost in the forest, dance in a clearing, lie down at the beach, hop over ancient ruins, inquire with the locals in the big city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger is custom-built for emergent gameplay: missing a fireball may be your invitation from a benign encounter to a dangerous forest fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/019872d9936aaf1bf8b4a5d286137768.avif?t=1780884504\" width=1028 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/36c01c5a3e80b240e527cb9c6b0fdb02.poster.avif?t=1780884504\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/36c01c5a3e80b240e527cb9c6b0fdb02.webm?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/36c01c5a3e80b240e527cb9c6b0fdb02.mp4?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to stop for a moment, admire the scenery, and forage for useful tools off of the forest floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to spend your consumable items wisely. It may get you out of a tricky situation now, but amassing enough will unlock even more powerful, permanent effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/9f0f0e329bcd97d1061f0d3450b7ac60.avif?t=1780884504\" width=1028 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/8488c7d0aa2bf4c664a68372897dd5e4.poster.avif?t=1780884504\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/8488c7d0aa2bf4c664a68372897dd5e4.webm?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/8488c7d0aa2bf4c664a68372897dd5e4.mp4?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be surprised at a burst of colourful particles, updating in real-time as opposed to turn-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UI is an intuitive experience, using animations, shapes and colours in place of traditional text-based information to capture a sense of exploration and wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the full-screen open world, where your cone of vision spreads all the way out to the edges of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/24d465330fed35e455305bf3764961b3.avif?t=1780884504\" width=1028 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/0cac700b574ccbaf6fb612f532737560.poster.avif?t=1780884504\" width=480 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/0cac700b574ccbaf6fb612f532737560.webm?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065900/extras/0cac700b574ccbaf6fb612f532737560.mp4?t=1780884504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the original adventure games, non-player characters in Ranger only move when you do. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though enemies' movements are turn-based, the projectiles they fire keep moving and particles continue exploding: you decide the pace of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through this wide open door to a sprawling, mysterious, enchanting universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span clas